// Motion Prompt #117 · MIT License (c) 2026 Shohei Ohtaki · https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/#117
//
// Teal and orange / ティール＆オレンジ
// Pack: photo (Photo looks, lighting & styles) · element 21 · Category: Tones & finishing looks
// What happens: In the same landscape the sky, hills, ground and the shadowed figure shift to teal while the sunlit edge of the figure and the sun shift to orange, a complementary contrast.
// Motion spec:
//   - Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. 
//   - Teal: sky #CFE6E3, hills #8CC1BE and #62A2A1, ground #3F8083, trees #2F6A6E, figure #1D4E53
//   - Orange: the light on the figure #FF9248, sun #FF8236, sun rings #FFC48C
//   - Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))
// When to use it: For a blockbuster, trailer-like look with strong colour contrast.
// Tags: teal and orange, orange and teal, cinematic, color grading, blockbuster, film look
// Size: 539x208 px · Cycle: 5 s
// Needs: kit photo -> https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/api/v1/kit/photo.js
// Live demo: https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/#117
//
// cells[i](k, w, h, u): k = CanvasRenderingContext2D (already cleared and wrapped in save/restore by the caller), w,h = size, u = seconds in [0, cycle). The picture depends only on u.
// Element code starts here. CELLS, constants and helpers live in the kit.

// @element 21
// ティール＆オレンジ: 空と影を青緑、日の当たる肌と太陽を橙に寄せる
CELLS[20] = cell((k, u) => {
  const a = env(u);
  const TO = {
    sky: '#CFE6E3', sky2: '#B7DAD6', far: '#8CC1BE', mid: '#62A2A1', ground: '#3F8083', ground2: '#2F6A6E', mark: '#CFE6E3', cast: '#2F6A6E',
    bld: '#A8D1CE', edge: '#4E8E8F', win: '#62A2A1', winOff: '#62A2A1', tree: '#2F6A6E', trunk: '#1F5357', post: '#1F5357', bulb: '#1F5357',
    person: '#1D4E53', shade: '#143F43', lit: '#FF9248', car: '#2F6A6E', glass: '#CFE6E3', tire: '#143F43', sun: '#FF8236', glow: '#FFC48C'
  };
  stageLand(k, pal(BASE, TO, a));
});
